@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/[reaction_uuid]
actor "Der Client" as Client
participant "WorkspaceMessageReactionController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nKanonische Zeilen + Anschlüsse" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ Typisierte Aufgaben ausführen" as Outbox
participant "Worker scope=message\nexact lease + fencing" as Worker
database "Fertige Projektionen\nKontainerbindungen" as Projection
database "Speicher für öffentliche Veranstaltungen" as Events
participant "- Das ist der Controller . WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "Der Client WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/{reaction_uuid}
API -> DB: resolve applicable public placement;\ncheck active membership + generation
API -> DB: delete one canonical fact + immutable outbox event
DB --> API: Transaktion festzulegen
API --> Client: eine erfolgreiche öffentliche Antwort
DB ->> Outbox: festgehaltenes Ereignis
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable reaction_snapshot(outbox_event_uuid)\nOhne coalescing
Worker -> Worker: claim (project_id, canonical_message_uuid)\nlease + fencing
Worker -> Projection: MESSAGE.reactions + reaction_users
Worker -> Events: message_reaction.deleted + message.updated\nAtomisch in einer DB transaction mit einer Projektion
Events ->> Dispatcher: festgelegte bereitgestellte Zeile
Dispatcher ->> WS: Versenden / Wiederholen / Wiederholen
note over API,Worker
  Topic lock nicht verwendet; retry/backoff + DLQ/reaper.
  Wiederherstellungsmethode placement context für reaction_uuid Bleibt.
  Zentralisierte OPEN-Entscheidung; arbitrary placement Verboten.
end note
@enduml
